  "about": "Resize project (row 69): how much the content grows (fit = whole old frame shows, fill = new frame covered, keep = same pixel sizes), the scale factor a video, picture, sticker or shape gets (its drawn size follows the content once its fit to the new canvas is allowed for), the factor a text element gets (font size follows the canvas height), and the caption bottom margin (a share of the height: clear of platform buttons on a tall canvas). Positions and pixel settings (outline width, shadow offset and blur, mask feather and stroke) scale by `content`. Expected values from an independent Python reference; apps/web/src/resize/plan.ts and crates/editor/src/resize.rs are both checked against them.",
